    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "This Court vide order dated 09.05.2024 directed the learned counsel for the State seeking an explanation from the I.I.C., Angul Sadar P.S. with regard to the discrepancy appearing in the F.I.R.\nregistered as Talcher P.S. Case No.218 of 2023 which was purported to have been registered for the offence under Sections 420/406/120- B/34, whereas on verification, the said F.I.R. reveals to have been registered for the offence under Section.279, IPC and Section 185 of the M.V. Act, 1988.\n2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
